  "about": "One golden table of zoned-time cases, run by the phone's local delivery plan (src/notifications/__tests__/localDelivery.test.ts) and by push-sender's policy (_shared/push_policy_zoned.test.ts), so the two implementations of quiet hours and the local day cannot drift (T7 review n2). quiet: 'in' is whether t falls in [start, end); 'deferTo' is where a notification due at t is held to (the next quiet end), null when it is not in quiet hours. day: the local calendar day of t. Only zones that both Intl and the server know are used; an unknown zone is left out on purpose (the phone normalises it to UTC, the server falls back to its default zone).",
